{"author":{"id":"337a442880d7106d509ff84f2f7fef51acce8bce88b081d4f4c3f0298b7e7941"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1791771312,"nonce":"UAG7FL5odamD33NRqn+t7Y5sssM=","title":"Review minors: apply-link ranking (PR 130)","message":"From PR 130 final check: a) capture.offer_apply_link marks any decoded off-site destination chosen_by=capture, including job boards; on link_same_job a board URL can replace a verified ATS link (regression from main); set chosen_by=capture only when HostClasses employer_or_ats(url). b) 5+ letter employer-key prefix matching gives false positives (Robert Half -\u003e robertwalters.com, Allied Universal -\u003e alliedhealthjobs); require a word boundary or full label. c) unreachable tracker (500, unresolved) outranks a live board copy and is never retried; consider retrying unresolved rows. d) board country domains (glassdoor.co.uk/.ca, monster.co.uk/.ca, ziprecruiter.co.uk, careerbuilder.ca, simplyhired.ca) and Built In city sites (builtinnyc.com etc.) missing from AGGREGATOR_HOSTS.","files":null}]}